{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06924","headline":"赠三侍御 · 常建","name":"赠三侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高山临大泽，正月芦花乾。\n阳色薰两崖，不改青松寒。\n士贤守孤贞，古来皆共难。\n明君错甚才，台上飞三鸾。\n操与霜雪明，量与江海宽。\n束身视天涯，安能穷波澜。\n孤鹤在枳棘，一枝非所安。\n逸翮望绝霄，见欲凌云端。\n层台何其高，山石流洪湍。\n固知非天池，鸣跃同所欢。\n谁念独枯槁，四十长江干。\n责躬贵知己，效拙从一官。\n折翮悲高风，苦饥候朝飡。\n湖月映大海，天空何漫漫。\n托身未知所，谋道庶不刊。\n吟彼乔木诗，一夕常三叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}